<title>FRANCE: Algeria seeks 30,000 tonnes U.S or Argentine maize.</title>
<headline>Algeria seeks 30,000 tonnes U.S or Argentine maize.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria is in the grain market for 30,000 tonnes of U.S. or Argentine maize in two equal shipments of 15,000 tonnes, grain traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Shipment is for February 10-28.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146</p>
